{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b20ca56fa02b22aa","name":"Expert Pilot Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-b20ca56fa02b22aa","title":"Expert Pilot Talent Tree","revision":18160,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:41:14Z","sha256":"9721cd2d8afca078d41fe5242ef907e5ea905f42109adc1c83d45e372c40e902","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18160","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Expert%20Pilot%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b20ca56fa02b22aa","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ace Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ace_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:3c2fd5c8fcea1d9d"}," relies on finely honed instincts and years of pilot training to outmaneuver and destroy enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Elusive Dogfighter"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When engaged in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},", any enemy pilot engaged in the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"}," takes a -10 penalty on attack rolls when you succeed on the opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Full Throttle"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Increase Vehicle Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Increase_Vehicle_Speed","referenceId":"reference:66150dedfb2d6b7a"},". In addition, when you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Out Movement"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Out_Movement","referenceId":"reference:c3e269326f94373b"}," Action, your Vehicle moves up to five times its normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," (instead of the normal four times).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Juke"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Vehicular Evasion"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fly Defensively"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fly_Defensively"}," as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", you may negate a weapon hit on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"}," feat one additional time per round.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Keep it Together"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you're ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," takes damage that equals or exceeds its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," avoids moving down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Relentless Pursuit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You may roll twice for any opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check made to initiate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},", keeping the better result.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vehicular Evasion"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," is hit by an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},", it takes half damage if the attack hits. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," misses your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", it takes no damage. You cannot use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," when your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," is stationary or disabled.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blind Spot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can fly a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," so close to a target at least two sizes larger than your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that it is difficult for the target to avoid or attack you. You must be adjacent to the target (at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},") to use this Talent. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", make an opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check against the target. If you succeed, you move into the same space as your target. You move with your target if it moves (assuming your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," has sufficient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," to keep up), and you must make another opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check each round as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to stay in its ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blind Spot"]},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As long as you stay in the target's ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blind Spot"]},", any attack you make against the target gains a +2 bonus, and the target takes a -2 penalty on attacks made against you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Clip"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ram","referenceId":"reference:76e11af94d353c6e"}," Action, you reduce the size of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," by two categories for the purposes of taking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"}," damage. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rammed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rammed"}," Vehicle takes damage appropriate to the actual size of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Close Scrape"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," of Colossal size or smaller, you may make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to turn a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," into a normal hit. The DC for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check is equal to the attack roll total of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},". If you are successful, the damage from the attack is not doubled (though it is still considered an automatic hit).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Attack Run"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You do not have to move in a straight line when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Run","referenceId":"reference:f6ed2aeeaa4b0e5f"}," Action.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Master Defender"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fly Defensively"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fly_Defensively"},", either your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," gains a +5 dodge bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," if you and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," take a -2 penalty to attack rolls, or it gains a +10 dodge bonus if you and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," take a -5 penalty to attack rolls.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Renowned Pilot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your reputation as a skilled pilot precedes you and bolsters the resolve of your allies. All allies within 6 squares of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of can reroll one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check, keeping the better of the two results. Once an ally has used this ability, that same ally cannot gain this Talent's benefit during the same encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Roll Out"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Elusive Dogfighter"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert at escaping ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfights"},". When making an opposed check to disengage from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},", you can reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check, taking the better result.  If you fail, you remain in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},", but the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," do not take penalties to their attack rolls. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shunt Damage"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, if your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," takes damage, make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of one adjacent allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},". If your check result is higher, the allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," takes the damage instead.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vehicle Focus"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Choose a single type of Vehicle from the following list:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeders","referenceId":"reference:8831ac17fd67f6fc"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Speeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeders","referenceId":"reference:be93ac2e4867f0ca"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Walkers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walkers","referenceId":"reference:552672704065a9f2"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," of that type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", you gain a +2 bonus to all attack rolls with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"},", and may ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks made while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Piloting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Piloting"}," that type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", even when you are otherwise unable to.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wingman"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check to assist any allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeder"}," within 2 squares at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},". If you succeed, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"